(b) A visit to a computer room of a certain company reveals the following:

- the chair used by the computer operator is not adjustable;
- some bulbs in the room are not lit;
- the operator has to press hard on some keys of the keyboard when typing.

(i) Briefly describe three (3) health hazards the operator may be exposed to after working for long hours. (6 marks)

(ii) Explain the advice that the company can be given to prevent the health hazards described in (i) above. (3 marks)
